#: admin/class-ysec-admin-tables.php:224
msgid ""
"Administrator-managed durable policy. Source allow entries provide explicit trusted access, permanent block"
" entries stop the source before WordPress routing, and exact request exceptions scope automatic profile "
"matching. Smart adaptive response stays in its adaptive layer, while this section remains fully "
"administrator-controlled with self-lockout protection."
msgstr ""
"Politika durabbli mmaniġġjata mill-amministratur. Entrati allow tas-sors jipprovdu aċċess fdat espliċitu, "
"entrati block permanenti jwaqqfu s-sors qabel ir-routing ta’ WordPress, u eċċezzjonijiet ta’ talba eżatta "
"jillimitaw it-tqabbil awtomatiku tal-profil. Ir-rispons adattiv intelliġenti jibqa’ fis-saff adattiv "
"tiegħu, filwaqt li din it-taqsima tibqa’ kompletament taħt il-kontroll tal-amministratur bi protezzjoni "
"kontra self-lockout."

