msgstr "YSec irrifjuta li jneħħi fajl MU li ma jappartjenix lilu."

#: admin/class-ysec-admin.php:1862
msgid ""
"YSec rejects abusive direct submissions before WordPress creates a comment. Normal comments that reach "
"Pending or the WordPress Spam queue remain WordPress moderation decisions, not YSec blocks."
msgstr ""
"YSec jiċħad sottomissjonijiet diretti abbużivi qabel ma WordPress joħloq kumment. Kummenti normali li jaslu"
" Pending jew fil-kju Spam ta’ WordPress jibqgħu deċiżjonijiet ta’ moderazzjoni ta’ WordPress, mhux blokki "
"YSec."

