msgstr ""
"Yablonsky Security sab plugin tas-sigurtà attiv ieħor. Irrevedi s-saffi ta’ protezzjoni li jikkoinċidu u "
"assenja sid wieħed għal kull responsabbiltà ta’ infurzar."

#: includes/class-ysec-privacy.php:18
msgid ""
"Yablonsky Security records bounded security evidence needed to protect the site. Suspicious request "
"evidence can include a salted source identifier, an encrypted source IP, user agent, a country signal "
"supplied by a validated trusted proxy, and a redacted request query. Raw request evidence expires "
"automatically according to severity, while compact non-identifying daily rollups can be kept longer for "
"security trends. Firewall blocks are time-bounded and reversible. Optional Yablonsky AI analysis is "
"disabled by default and sends a structured evidence bundle only when an administrator enables the "
"integration and explicitly requests analysis."
msgstr ""
"Yablonsky Security jirreġistra evidenza tas-sigurtà limitata meħtieġa biex jipproteġi s-sit. Evidenza ta’ "
"talbiet suspettużi tista’ tinkludi identifikatur tas-sors salted, IP tas-sors encrypted, user agent, sinjal"
" tal-pajjiż ipprovdut minn proxy fdat u validat, u query tat-talba redacted. Evidenza mhux ipproċessata "
"tat-talbiet tiskadi awtomatikament skont is-severità, filwaqt li rollups kompatti ta’ kuljum li ma "
"jidentifikawx jistgħu jinżammu aktar għal xejriet tas-sigurtà. Blokki tal-firewall huma limitati fiż-żmien "
"u riversibbli. L-analiżi fakultattiva Yablonsky AI hija diżattivata b’mod default u tibgħat bundle "
"strutturat ta’ evidenza biss meta amministratur jattiva l-integrazzjoni u jitlob analiżi b’mod espliċitu."

